[[File:The Dead Acre.jpg|thumb|300px|The Dead Acre.]]

'''The Dead Acre''', formerly known as the '''Easton Fields''',<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|16|The Old Church of Westfall IX}}</ref> was once one of many [[farm]]s in southeast [[Westfall]], close to the bridge leading into [[Duskwood]]. However, when the [[Defias Brotherhood]] took control of Westfall, [[Carver Molsen]] and the Defias burned the farm and field that had once stood there, and murdered the Easton family. Now, only the smoking ruins remain with mechanical [[Harvest Watcher]]s roaming the smoldering fields.

